Where you evolve

00:34:45.580 --> 00:34:47.340
the dynamics of a robot

00:34:47.340 --> 00:34:49.160
using genetic algorithms

00:34:49.840 --> 00:34:50.960
and that's

00:35:00.020 --> 00:35:02.740
These robots have been taught to,

